Z||000000||82-T/A||11-21-2000||08:48 PM||||Someone sent me this link... <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/gallery/Cars/Breeann_Car2.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/gallery/Cars/Breeann_Car2.jpg</A> <P>And I traced it back to here.. looks like an awesome web site. I'm also on the Fiero List if anyone from there may know me, I am Todd Jaspers on the Fiero mailing list.<P>Lets see, I've been into Fieros for about 4-5 years now, I've owned about 5.. never wrecked one, I just fixed them up, and sold them and bought new ones. Only one that I've kept this whole time is my 1987 Fiero SE / V6. Never going to sell that one.<P>Archie, are you the Archie V8 with the Binford Tools V8 Fiero? I sold your friend Wolfgang here in Florida my 1985 Fiero 2m4 Coupe for a Ferrari job.<P>Anyway, just thought I'd send a quick note to introduce myself..<P>Oh, and if anyone happens to know who that girl is.. hehe.. feel free to let me know. Here are some pictures of my Fiero if your interested..... <BR> <A HREF="http://www.ezshots.com/album.cgi?82tafiero/Apartment" TARGET=_blank>http://www.ezshots.com/album.cgi?82tafiero/Apartment</A> <P><BR>||||reg||10
