Z||000028||82-T/A||11-24-2000||10:17 AM||||I took my Fiero to the Gym this morning.. first time I've actually driven it in like a month or something... I mean.. it's the first time I've taken it more than 1/4 of a mile in 6 months..<P><BR>droool........ arrrgg.... <BR>&lt;Homer Simpson Duff Beer drooling sounds&gt;<P>Theres a little bit of twisties from my apartment to there.... oh man.. it felt SOO good flying around those turns.. I friggin LOVE the way this car handles around turns.. DAMN!!! I guess you all know what it feels like, so I'm not telling you all anything new... but I guess I'm rediscovering my Fiero. After doing all that work to get it fixed up.. I haven't really had time to drive it. It broke down at 120k miles like 7 months ago.. and I bought a new Pontiac GrandAm... well a 1997.. and since then thats all I've been driving.. a little excitment.. but not Fiero Excitement..<P>I just went out and spent $100 bucks on stuff for my Fiero.<P>Since I don't have to work today (friday) I'm going to spend the whole day working on my Fiero.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Todd Jaspers<BR>1997 Pontiac GrandAm SE<BR>1987 Pontiac Fiero SE/V6<BR>1984 Pontiac Fiero 2m4 SE||||reg||1
